From 45dbc71c9f3452d289c383ed01927c6dc367b7c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:30:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(fixtures): generate 3-jaw, 4-jaw and collet lathe chucks

Three new built-in accessory kinds, generated from their figures as
closed steel shells (camcraft_sim::chuck): body with through bore and
2..12 jaws, or a collet nose over a body. Validated at command creation
(non-finite, zero or negative figures, a bore past the body, jaws past
the body or meeting each other, a collet bore past the nose - all by
name). A new OnStock placement (MCP fit_to_stock) closes a chuck on the
setup's round stock. The lathe holder law and the post gate read the
chuck like any fixture.

Refs #1442

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
